  ('keeping-your-cool-with-technology', 190, 'Unplug the router for a slow count to thirty when the internet stalls, and enjoy the short break it gives you.'),
  ('keeping-your-cool-with-technology', 191, 'Notice the urge to slam the laptop lid, and close it gently instead.'),
  ('keeping-your-cool-with-technology', 192, 'Create an email folder for receipts and move your recent order confirmations into it.'),
