  ('saying-goodbye-well', 244, 'Find a quiet room at work or school for five minutes when the farewells start to pile up.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 245, 'Offer a small kindness to a newcomer at work, such as showing them where the supplies are kept.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 246, 'Give yourself a gentle answer when someone asks how you feel about the change, even if it is only "a bit of everything."'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 247, 'Plan a goodbye coffee with a colleague from another department you rarely got the chance to thank.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 248, 'Make a pencil rubbing of a leaf, a plaque or the bark of a tree in a place you love, and keep the paper.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 249, 'Read back over an old card or note from this chapter, then put it somewhere you will find it later.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 250, 'Ask a new coworker how they found their way around when they first started, and listen closely.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 251, 'Admit to yourself one thing about the change that excites you, even if it feels too early to say.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 252, 'Wave to the bus driver on your last ride of your usual route, and say thanks as you step off.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 253, 'Share a favorite local spot with someone who is staying, so it keeps being loved.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 254, 'Accept one offer of help this week, even if your first instinct is to say you are fine.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 255, 'Put together a playlist for the new chapter with songs that make you feel hopeful about what comes next.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 256, 'Rest a hand on a doorframe you know well and silently say, "Thank you for holding so much."'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 257, 'Sit with your child in the evening and help them write a goodbye card to a friend from their class.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 258, 'Weed and water the garden bed so it is ready for whoever tends it after you.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 259, 'Wear your most comfortable shoes on the busiest day of the change, a small kindness to your feet.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 260, 'Draw a simple map of your new neighborhood from memory, then check it against a real one on a walk.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 261, 'Write a list of five ordinary moments from this chapter that you would like to remember.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 262, 'Tell a friend who is starting a new job that you are proud of them, and name one strength you have seen.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 263, 'Shake out the doormat and set it straight one last time, a small way of tidying up your welcome.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 264, 'Make your bed in the morning, even in a messy house, as one small steady thing.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 265, 'Look for one thing in your new routine that is better than the old one, however small, and enjoy it.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 266, 'Doodle a small symbol for this chapter in the corner of a page, like a key, a leaf or a bus, without thinking too hard.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 267, 'If you are the one staying behind, send the person leaving a note saying their spot here will always feel like theirs.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 268, 'Write directions to your favorite hidden spot here, so you can find it again on a future visit.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 269, 'Hum or sing a few lines of a song you love while you sort your things.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 270, 'Swap one old routine for a new one this morning, like a different walk or a fresh place to sit.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 271, 'Ask a trusted friend to check in with you once before the ending, and tell them what would help.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 272, 'Introduce a friend who is staying to someone you met here, so the connection keeps going after you leave.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 273, 'Sort a box of papers and recycle what no longer belongs in your next chapter.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 274, 'Allow extra time for everything you do today, so nothing has to be rushed.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 275, 'Observe which parts of the old routine you still reach for, and gently decide which ones to keep.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 276, 'Plan one simple outing with someone from this chapter, like a walk or a game of cards.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 277, 'Say a clear goodbye to a group you have been part of rather than slipping away quietly, even if it feels awkward.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 278, 'Close the curtains in an empty room tonight and say, "Thank you for keeping me safe."'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 279, 'Lean back on the grass on a warm summer evening and watch the clouds drift for a few minutes.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 280, 'Save the phone number of one new acquaintance and suggest a simple coffee or walk together.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 281, 'Sketch or describe the view from your favorite window in a few short lines.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 282, 'Wrap up one unfinished conversation with a friend before parting, even a small apology or a long overdue thank you.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 283, 'Go the long way to the store this autumn so you pass the trees you like best.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 284, 'Color in a page of a coloring book or a mandala for ten minutes while your mind settles.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 285, 'Say thank you to your old home in your mind as you pass a photo of it, then turn back to your day.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 286, 'Do one part of your daily routine that will stop soon, slowly and with your full attention.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 287, 'Stop by your community center to thank a volunteer for their kindness before you leave the area.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 288, 'Ask a neighbor who has lived here longest what the street was like years ago, and listen to the story.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 289, 'Share the load by asking each person in your household to take one task off your list.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 290, 'Share one thing you love about your new place with someone who knew you in the old one.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 291, 'Find something you wrote near the start of this chapter, if you have it, and see how much you have grown.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 292, 'Hand over a project at work with a short thank you to the person taking it on, wishing them well with it.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 293, 'Read the names on the mailboxes in your building or street and recall one kind moment with a neighbor.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 294, 'Put on a song you can dance to and move around the kitchen until it ends.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 295, 'Invite a friend who knew you before this change to tell you what they think you are carrying with you.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 296, 'Say goodbye to one small habit tied to this place, like a parking spot or a favorite bench, by doing it with care.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 297, 'On a rainy afternoon, write thank you notes to two people who made a past season of life easier.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 298, 'Invite the people you live with to name their favorite spot in this place, and really listen.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 299, 'Pick a calm spot in the new place, even a corner of a bare room, to sit quietly for five minutes each evening.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 300, 'Celebrate a quiet first in your new chapter, like your first library card or first familiar face.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 301, 'Set your phone aside in another room for ten minutes and sit with your feelings about what is changing.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 302, 'Return something you borrowed from a neighbor, and tuck a short note of thanks in with it.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 303, 'Curl up on a rainy afternoon in the chair you always chose, with nothing at all to do.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 304, 'Read a few pages of a favorite comforting book before bed instead of scrolling.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 305, 'Practice saying your new address or job title out loud a few times until it feels like yours.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 306, 'Read a short poem about beginnings and endings, and copy out the one line that fits how you feel.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 307, 'Call a grandparent or older relative to tell them about your move and thank them for their support.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 308, 'Save seeds from your garden and give them to a friend so a piece of this place keeps growing.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 309, 'Fill a jar with notes about good moments from this season and keep it as a small treasure.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 310, 'Pause on your way home this evening and look at the sky over your new neighborhood for a full minute.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 311, 'Watch the sunset from a familiar spot on a fall evening and let it mark the closing of something.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 312, 'Offer to be a reference or a listening ear for someone you are leaving behind at work or school.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 313, 'Print your best photo of this place and write a short caption on the back.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 314, 'Do a simple puzzle or crossword in a quiet moment to give your busy mind a break.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 315, 'Welcome yourself home in your new place with a small ritual, like setting your keys in the same spot and taking a deep breath at the door.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 316, 'Imagine yourself a year from now looking back on this ending, and write one kind thing that future you might say.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 317, 'Arrange to meet a departing friend at your usual bench for a last unhurried conversation.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 318, 'Wash the windows in one room you are leaving and enjoy a clear last look through the glass.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 319, 'Spend a slow morning in pajamas on a free weekend, with no plans until lunch.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 320, 'Return a message you have been putting off from someone in your old life, keeping it short and kind.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 321, 'Jot down one worry about what comes next, then one small thing that would make it a little easier.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 322, 'Write down three things you want to remember about a friend before they leave, then tell them one.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 323, 'Watch the sunrise from a spot you have loved, wrapped in a blanket if it is cold.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 324, 'Stretch slowly for five minutes before bed after a long day of goodbyes.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 325, 'Explore your new area by bus, train or bike once, getting off somewhere you have never been.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 326, 'Let a mentor or older relative know about the change and ask how they handled a similar one.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 327, 'Agree with a close friend on a date for your first catch up call after the move, and put it on both calendars.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 328, 'Pause to read the community board at your local shop or library, and notice what this place cares about.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 329, 'Let go of one "should" today, like a perfect packing plan, and settle for good enough instead.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 330, 'Sort the contacts in your phone, adding a note to the ones you want to call this season.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 331, 'Walk the hallway, aisle or path you know best at work or school and take in what you want to remember.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 332, 'Snap a photo with a friend you are parting from in a place you both know, and send it to them that evening.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 333, 'Spend the last hour in a place without packing anything at all, simply being in it.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 334, 'Hug someone you love a little longer today, or wrap your arms around yourself in a gentle squeeze.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 335, 'Invite a friend from the old chapter to visit your new place, and pick a season that would suit them.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 336, 'Help a child in your life name what is ending for them, like a school year or a favorite teacher moving on.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 337, 'Close a goodbye conversation by saying what you hope for the other person, not only what you will miss.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 338, 'Look for the shop window on your street that changes with the seasons and enjoy it once more.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 339, 'Get outside in the first warm days of spring and let the fresh air remind you that seasons change gently.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 340, 'Answer the question "Who am I becoming here?" in a few lines, without needing to get it right.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 341, 'Pick up one fallen leaf or smooth pebble from a familiar path to keep as a small reminder.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 342, 'Pause after a goodbye and take three slow breaths before you carry on with your day.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 343, 'Collect the local bus or train map you used most and tuck it in a book as a souvenir of your routes.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 344, 'Check in with yourself at noon by asking, "What do I need right now?" and give yourself one small piece of it.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 345, 'Spend a rainy afternoon in your new place reading, napping or sorting photos, letting it start to feel like home.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 346, 'Pause before dinner and share one sentence with your household about the chapter that is closing.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 347, 'Share a few words of thanks with your book club, choir or support group at your last gathering.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 348, 'Visit a beach, lake or river you love in late summer and let the water be part of your goodbye.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 349, 'Step out for a short walk among fallen leaves and let each crunch be one less thing to carry.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 350, 'Notice a kindness a new neighbor or coworker showed you this week and thank them for it.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 351, 'Wear a sweater or jacket from this season and let the memories it carries come along with you.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 352, 'Ask your manager for a few minutes so you can thank them for the chances they gave you here.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 353, 'Fix one small thing so you leave it better than you found it, like a squeaky hinge or a smudged mirror.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 354, 'Text a friend one honest word about how the goodbye went, and let them reply in their own time.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 355, 'Tuck a note in your bag that says "New does not have to feel easy yet," and read it when you need it.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 356, 'End the day by writing "I am allowed to feel all of this" at the bottom of a page.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 357, 'Leave a kind review or shout out for a small local business that served you well while you lived here.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 358, 'Listen for the school bell, train whistle or ice cream truck that marks time here, and stop to notice it.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 359, 'Clean one small thing until it shines, like a sink or a pair of shoes, for an easy sense of order.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 360, 'Make a plan to visit the old place someday, then let it rest so you can be fully where you are now.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 361, 'Celebrate one small way you have already started moving toward what comes next.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 362, 'End the day by writing a thank you note to yourself for saying goodbye with so much care.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 363, 'Glance around a place you are leaving and say, "I am glad I was here," before you step out.'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 364, 'Look in the mirror before you turn off the light tonight and say, "You did a brave thing."'),
  ('saying-goodbye-well', 365, 'Close your day by writing one sentence of gratitude for the ending and one for the beginning.')
) as v(slug, day, task)
